#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: woo-force-authentification-before-checkout.php
msgid "Force Authentification Before Checkout for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Force Authentification Before Checkout for WooCommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: woo-force-authentification-before-checkout.php
msgid ""
"Force customer to log in or register before checkout, with optional email "
"OTP authentication."
msgstr ""
"Force o cliente a fazer login ou se registrar antes da finalização, com "
"autenticação OTP por e-mail opcional."

